      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As far as I'm aware, VRChat sticks with LTS builds of Unity. Given Unity 2022 doesn't currently have one and likely won't for quite some time, it's unlikely we'll see an update to Unity 2022 any time soon (potentially years). Not to mention I believe VRChat takes some measures to prevent as much content from breaking as possible when upgrading Unity versions, which would extend that time even further.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
