      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Bad news 1:\nVRChat doesn't go for bleeding edge. The team chooses Unity's LTS variants of Unity.\nGood news:\nUnity 2019 is going to expire, according to endoflife.date.\nhttps://endoflife.date/unity\nAnd according to the image I've attached, we might see 2022 LTS released next year.\nBad news 2:\nVRChat will either go with 2020 LTS or 2021 LTS.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
